"is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "剧情对话", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "collapse_panel", "layout": "", "data": "{\"rich_text\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\">〓路线攻略〓</span></strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\">具体路线攻略推荐：<a href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/36350461\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">珐露珊邀约攻略</a>  作者：<a href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/accountCenter/postList?id=82367888\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\">橙柒柒</span></strong></a></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\">End1 过去的故事</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/c0c06c956e164ff6a81164f6e12f59dc_2930615688910031390.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\">早已过去的故事，如今也在熠熠生辉。</span></em></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\">End2 知识就是财富！</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/9ebd794856e240d100c535fe204667c2_5305141343980102065.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\">只要是知识，总会有用处。</span></em></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\">End3 园丁与苗圃</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/27c1e830797aba90136e2c2a10ce4ece_315835572185516345.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\">「只要乐于求知，就算不在我门下也无所谓...</span></em></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\">不过真的不能再考虑一下吗？知论派的课也很有意思的！」</span></em></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\">End4 再启动</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/1e7b8206ef7e14462ceaa9ad460962f5_2038017550080256969.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\">新的朋友，新的生命，新的开始。</span></em></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\">End5 「欢迎回来，珐露珊。」</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/4f08a12c2203111c85afba80b84bca12_5868827281403484024.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\">她曾沿着时间流浪，此刻终于归乡。</span></em></p>\",\"switch\":false,